==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*6 [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*6 [[Croco]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that can be beaten by spamming [[Super Mr.]].

==Trivia==
*Fuku Domain is named after the Japanese word 福 ''fuku'' (luck; fortune).

